R136 - PS4 skater equipment (helmet / gloves / skates / stick / visor): database value -> Creation Zone catalogue row -> vault typed
enum -> thumbnail member, per distinct PS4 source (research package 3 tail, 28 Sep 2026). Read-only.
Per family:
  DB     exhibitionskaterequipment.<col> (distinct values, rows) and exhibitionteams.<col> where declared (team defaults);
  CSV    creation_zone_csv/<file> (id column, render id column, name key column), if shipped;
  vault  every enum attribute of the family's texture-pack / geometry classes: value set, and which enum covers the DB values best
         (enum NAME recorded - a typed schema value, not a filename correlation);
  thumbs creationzone/equipment/<dir>/<dir><N>.gnf|png numbers;
Coverage is reported both ways (DB values in CSV ids / in the enum set / with a thumbnail; CSV ids with a thumbnail; thumbnails not in the
CSV). Joins are data joins; which item the game draws is not observed.
Usage: python r136_ps4_skater_gear_catalogue.py <out.json>
